<!--
  Long-press context menu of a library tile, shown by MainActivity in a
  PopupWindow anchored BELOW the card (the stock PopupMenu opens above
  the anchor with square corners and 48 dp rows). Compact 40 dp rows on
  a 16 dp rounded panel (see bg_game_context.xml); colors follow the
  M3/Material You palette.

